{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-product","blocks":{"vendor":{"type":"text","disabled":true,"settings":{"text":"{{ product.vendor }}","text_style":"uppercase"}},"title":{"type":"title","settings":{}},"caption":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"{{ product.metafields.descriptors.subtitle.value }}","text_style":"subtitle"}},"price":{"type":"price","settings":{}},"variant_picker":{"type":"variant_picker","settings":{"picker_type":"button"}},"quantity_selector":{"type":"quantity_selector","settings":{}},"buy_buttons":{"type":"buy_buttons","settings":{"show_sticky_cart":true,"is_set":false,"set_size":3,"set_text":"Wähle 3 Produkte","show_dynamic_checkout":false,"gang_url":""}},"description":{"type":"description","settings":{}},"collapsible-row-0":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Shipping","icon":"truck","content":"<p>Wir versenden den Kalender bis Ende Oktober<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-1":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Content (attention spoiler)","icon":"box","content":"","page":""}},"collapsible-row-2":{"type":"collapsible_tab","disabled":true,"settings":{"heading":"Dimensions","icon":"ruler","content":"","page":""}},"collapsible-row-3":{"type":"collapsible_tab","disabled":true,"settings":{"heading":"Care Instructions","icon":"heart","content":"","page":""}}},"block_order":["vendor","title","caption","price","variant_picker","quantity_selector","buy_buttons","description","collapsible-row-0","collapsible-row-1","collapsible-row-2","collapsible-row-3"],"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":true,"enable_sticky_info":true,"gallery_layout":"thumbnail","media_size":"medium","mobile_thumbnails":"hide","hide_variants":true,"enable_video_looping":false,"padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":12}},"image-with-text":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"image-with-text-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Für deinen ganz besonderen Dezember","heading_size":"h2"}},"image-with-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Der diesjährige Moonshine Adventskalender beinhaltet die <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnell.de\/collections\/moonshine\" target=\"_blank\">besten Moonshine Sorten<\/a>, viele exklusive Artikel und einen brandneuen Winterlikör, den es nur im Kalender geben wird. Egal ob für Moonshine Neulinge oder hartgesottene Fans, der Adventskalender hält für jeden tolle Geschmackserlebnisse und Überraschungsmomente bereit. Er besteht aus klimaneutralem Karton und alle Produkte überzeugen wie immer durch ihre ausgezeichnete Qualität.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["image-with-text-0","image-with-text-1"],"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":false,"background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#000000","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Adventskalender_23_8N1A6651_klein_2.jpg","image_caption":"","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":4}},"4d692f58-f531-40a2-b43d-deb3cba6556f":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--16204397019404__4d692f58-f531-40a2-b43d-deb3cba6556f-166815485475a11657-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Was im Kalender enthalten ist?","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--16204397019404__4d692f58-f531-40a2-b43d-deb3cba6556f-166815485475a11657-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Das bleibt natürlich eine Überraschung, bis du die Türchen im Dezember öffnest (einen kleinen Spoiler findest du, wenn du ganz nach unten scrollst). Aber wir haben viele Monate damit verbracht, den Kalender aus dem letzten Jahr noch einmal für dich zu toppen - und das ist uns gelungen. Alles überzeugt durch ausgezeichnete Qualität, der Kalender ist aus klimaneutralem Karton gefertigt und wie jedes Jahr gilt - nur solange der Vorrat reicht!<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--16204397019404__4d692f58-f531-40a2-b43d-deb3cba6556f-166815485475a11657-0","template--16204397019404__4d692f58-f531-40a2-b43d-deb3cba6556f-166815485475a11657-1"],"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":false,"background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#000000","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Adventskalender_23_8N1A6651_klein_1.jpg","image_caption":"","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0}},"b615832a-bf64-4713-96d7-c66978a6bdf5":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--16204397019404__b615832a-bf64-4713-96d7-c66978a6bdf5-166815485475a11657-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"5 kurze Fragen zum Kalender","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--16204397019404__b615832a-bf64-4713-96d7-c66978a6bdf5-166815485475a11657-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p><strong>1. Wie viele verschiedene Likör-Sorten sind im Adventskalender enthalten?<\/strong><\/p><p><em>Acht verschiedene Liköre.<\/em><\/p><p><strong>2. Wann wird der Kalender geliefert?<\/strong><\/p><p><em>Der Versand erfolgt im Oktober.<\/em><\/p><p><strong>3. Ist der Inhalt der gleiche, wie in den letzten Jahren?<\/strong><\/p><p><em>Nein, der Inhalt des Kalenders ist neu - aber unsere besten Moonshine sind natürlich wieder dabei.<\/em><\/p><p><strong>4. Ist der Kalender vegan?<\/strong><\/p><p><em>Die Liköre sind vegan & frei von Allergenen, zwei andere Produkte im Kalender sind allerdings nicht vegan.<\/em><\/p><p><strong>5. Kommt die Sorte aus dem Kalender ins normale Sortiment?<\/strong><\/p><p><em>Erst einmal nicht, die Sorte wird es nur mit dem Kalender geben. Aber wenn unsere O’Donnell Community nach Weihnachten nicht auf den Moonshine verzichten will, wird es eine Abstimmung dazu geben.<\/em><\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--16204397019404__b615832a-bf64-4713-96d7-c66978a6bdf5-166815485475a11657-0","template--16204397019404__b615832a-bf64-4713-96d7-c66978a6bdf5-166815485475a11657-1"],"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":false,"background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#000000","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Adventskalender_23_8N1A6651_klein_3.jpg","image_caption":"","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":4,"padding_bottom":36}},"multicolumn":{"type":"multicolumn","blocks":{"column-0":{"type":"column","settings":{"title":"Free Shipping","text":"<p>Pair text with an image to focus on your chosen product, collection, or blog post. Add details on availability, style, or even provide a review.<\/p>","link_label":"","link":""}},"column-1":{"type":"column","settings":{"title":"Hassle-Free Exchanges","text":"<p>Pair text with an image to focus on your chosen product, collection, or blog post. Add details on availability, style, or even provide a review.<\/p>","link_label":"","link":""}}},"block_order":["column-0","column-1"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":false,"title":"","heading_size":"h1","image_width":"full","image_ratio":"adapt","columns_desktop":2,"column_alignment":"left","background_style":"none","button_label":"","button_link":"","color_scheme":"background-1","columns_mobile":"1","swipe_on_mobile":false,"padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"product-recommendations":{"type":"product-recommendations","settings":{"heading":"Das könnte Dir auch gefallen","heading_size":"h1","products_to_show":4,"columns_desktop":4,"color_scheme":"background-1","image_ratio":"square","show_secondary_image":true,"show_vendor":false,"show_rating":false,"grey_sold_out_products":true,"columns_mobile":"2","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":28}}},"order":["main","image-with-text","4d692f58-f531-40a2-b43d-deb3cba6556f","b615832a-bf64-4713-96d7-c66978a6bdf5","multicolumn","product-recommendations"]}